OL,3,CCustomers count the costs: Bank
OL,4,Cclosures in the south of Scotland
OL,6,FITV Border's Alice Neil went to meet
OL,7,Fsome of the residents and businesses
OL,8,Fimpacted by bank closures
OL,10,FThe past decade has seen a significant
OL,11,Fdecline in high street banking.
OL,13,FAlmost 70 per cent of banks and
OL,14,Fbuilding societies have been lost in
OL,15,Fthe south of Scotland since 2015
OL,16,Faccording to consumer group Which?
OL,18,FFour more branches are set for
OL,19,Fclosure, with residents and businesses
OL,20,Fsaying it's becoming more difficult to
OL,21,Faccess and manage their money.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
