OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786380476
OL,3,CCustomers count the costs: Bank
OL,4,Cclosures in the south of Scotland
OL,6,FSandra Gliston is 85 and lives in
OL,7,FLockerbie. Her bank branch shut last
OL,8,Fyear and she now uses building society
OL,9,Fon her local high street, but it's
OL,10,Fonly open for part of the week.
OL,12,FShe pays with cash for most everyday
OL,13,Fexpenses but says when her branch is
OL,14,Fshut, she sometimes travels almost two
OL,15,Fhours by bus to withdraw money.
OL,17,FSandra is concerned about using online
OL,18,Fbanking and doesn't feel safe
OL,19,Fwithdrawing money in public places.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,329,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786380476
OL,3,CCustomers count the costs: Bank
OL,4,Cclosures in the south of Scotland
OL,6,F"I don't like standing outside the
OL,7,Fstreet in case somebody just pinches
OL,8,Fmy money before I can get it into my
OL,9,Fbag
OL,11,F"I don't think I'm confident enough to
OL,12,Fuse it, you know, and if I get the
OL,13,Fwrong thing, it might just take all of
OL,14,Fmy money away."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
