OL,3,CCustomers count the costs: Bank
OL,4,Cclosures in the south of Scotland
OL,6,FNew figures from the Building
OL,7,FSocieties Association found that 75
OL,8,Fper cent of people say their local
OL,9,Fbranch makes managing their money
OL,10,Feasier and 26 per cent say in person
OL,11,Fbanking has helped prevent them from
OL,12,Fgetting scammed.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
