CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786380476
OL,3,CCustomers count the costs: Bank
OL,4,Cclosures in the south of Scotland
OL,6,FMember of Parliament for
OL,7,FDumfriesshire, Clydesdale and
OL,8,FTweeddale, David Mundell, believes
OL,9,Fhigh street banking is essential for
OL,10,Frural communities: "It's absolutely
OL,11,Fvital that people in rural areas have
OL,12,Ffirstly access to cash, but also face-
OL,13,Fto-face banking services, and the
OL,14,Fdisgrace is that all the big banks
OL,15,Fhave effectively given up on rural
OL,16,Fareas
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
