CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786380476
OL,3,CCustomers count the costs: Bank
OL,4,Cclosures in the south of Scotland
OL,6,FThe Cumberland Building Society has
OL,7,Fbranches across Cumbria and the south
OL,8,Fof Scotland. They have recently
OL,9,Fpledged to maintain a presence on the
OL,10,Fhigh street and said that face-to-face
OL,11,Fservices are crucial.
OL,13,FStuart Miller, Chief Executive of the
OL,14,FCumberland Building Society, said:
OL,15,F"We've embedded ourselves in local
OL,16,Fcommunities in many different ways,
OL,17,Fbut we think the most important way is
OL,18,Fmaintaining that physical presence on
OL,19,Fthe high street.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,329,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786380476
OL,3,CCustomers count the costs: Bank
OL,4,Cclosures in the south of Scotland
OL,6,F"We've been doing a lot of listening
OL,7,Fand the feedback has been really clear.
OL,9,F"Having a place you can come, ask
OL,10,Fquestions, get help, support, advice
OL,11,Fis what our customers tell us is
OL,12,Fimportant.
OL,14,F"In this day of lots of fantastic
OL,15,Fdigital solutions, you know that warm,
OL,16,Ffriendly face is something they really
OL,17,Fappreciate and is something they are
OL,18,Ftelling us to maintain.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G7/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,329,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786380476
OL,3,CCustomers count the costs: Bank
OL,4,Cclosures in the south of Scotland
OL,6,F"It's also absolutely vital to small
OL,7,Fbusinesses. A lot do still take cash,
OL,8,Fand rely on cash, so having to travel
OL,9,F50, 60, 70 miles is just not
OL,10,Frealistic, and of course we rely on
OL,11,Flocal businesses to support the health
OL,12,Fof local communities.
OL,14,FRyan Johnstone owns a cafe in
OL,15,FLockerbie and says branch closures are
OL,16,Fmaking it harder to deposit customers'
OL,17,Fcash
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G8/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,329,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1786380476
OL,3,CCustomers count the costs: Bank
OL,4,Cclosures in the south of Scotland
OL,6,F"We always want to accept cash because
OL,7,Fa lot of people, especially the older
OL,8,Fgeneration around here, love to pay
OL,9,Fwith cash, but it is a hassle
OL,10,Fsometimes, because it's hard to
OL,11,Fdeposit the cash into the bank
OL,12,Faccount, and the only options are the
OL,13,Fpost office, where the volume is
OL,14,Flimited that we can deposit or we have
OL,15,Fto take it to a branch in Dumfries."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G9/9
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
